OL,3,AEmployers should teach primary-age
OL,4,Achildren about work, says Milburn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest data from the Office for
OL,7,FNational Statistics (ONS) suggests
OL,8,F981,000 people aged 16 to 24 in the UK
OL,9,Fwere not in education, employment or
OL,10,Ftraining (known as Neet), between April
OL,11,Fand June 2026.
